## Consolidation actions

| Family | Current pages | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Results | 12 pages, inconsistent slugs | Restructure under `/racing/results/`, rename to `YYYY[-YY]-season` slugs, add a hub page showing the current season with an archive list |
| Grand Prix | 12 pages (1 hub + 11 seasons) | Move under `/racing/grand-prix/`, keep the existing year-season slug pattern (it already works) |
| Event Reports / News | `news-2/` + 6 pages, overlapping the dated blog | Migrate into `/news/` as dated posts; 301-redirect old URLs; verify the Autumn Marathons 2021 duplicate before merging |
| `about-the-club` | empty page | Retire, 301 → `/about/` |
| `join-the-club` (top-level) | empty page | Retire, 301 → `/membership/join/` |
| `contact-us` / `contact-us-2` | two implementations | Keep one (recommend the static mailto version — no plugin dependency, can't silently break), retire the other with a redirect |
| `shop` / `shop-2` | two implementations | Keep the transactional `/shop/`; fold any unique informational copy from `shop-2` into `/membership/club-kit/`, then retire it |
| `teams/second-team`, `teams/another-team` | placeholder/test fixtures data | Delete outright — not real content, shouldn't be publicly live at all |
| `teams/*` (the rest) | internal opponent/fixtures data, gated | Remove from public site structure entirely; it's admin/fixtures tooling, not visitor-facing content |

## Notes carried over from the content review

- The `/join/` (not `/join/join-the-club/`) membership form's admin dropdown leaks real member
  names to anonymous visitors — must not be reintroduced in any rebuilt Join flow.
- Two mailto links on `contact-us-2` were missing the `mailto:` prefix on the *live* site (broken
  even today) — already corrected in the archive; carry the fix forward.
- `club-calendar/` and the `teams/*` GravityView pages render nothing useful without a login/JS —
  confirm what (if anything) a logged-out visitor is meant to see before rebuilding them.
